{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"rock_saltpetre","model_identifier":"rock_saltpetre","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# rock_saltpetre\n\nSaltpetre node: white crust on a cave wall (a rock face 80 u wide, 70 u tall).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -40..50, y 0..85, z -12..17 units (2.52 x 2.40 x 0.83 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 128 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 19.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 90 x 85 x 30 (w x h x d), centred at x 5, z 2\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default): untouched node\n- `depleted`: mined out: smaller broken chunks and gravel\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `hit` | 0.3 | once | short shake when struck (both sets) |\n"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"rock0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-40.0,0.0,-1.0],"to":[40.0,70.0,17.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,80.0,70.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[80.0,0.0,98.0,70.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,80.0,70.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[80.0,0.0,98.0,70.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[44.0,110.0,124.0,128.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[44.0,110.0,124.0,128.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"40925949-18f5-5995-9843-05f8f9e802f7"},{"name":"rock0_cap","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-25.6,70.0,2.6],"to":[24.0,85.4,13.76],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,